            <div class="look-item"><span class="look-icon">IB</span><span>IB, PE, search fund, valuation, finance internships</span></div>
            <div class="look-item"><span class="look-icon">TX</span><span>DFW first; Austin, Houston, and remote if strong</span></div>
            <div class="look-item"><span class="look-icon">$</span><span>$18-$35/hour internships; analyst upside later</span></div>
          </div>
          <a class="rail-button" href="preferences.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Tune preferences</a>
        </section>

        <section>
